Bundle-Description: Model Atlas REST client — public API. \
 Client interfaces (ModelAtlasClient, RemoteEPackageProvider, DriftListener, \
 DriftReport), the ClientConfiguration value type, the JakartaRsClientProvider \
 SPI, the atlas.* origin-property constants and the typed exception hierarchy. \
 Shared contract for both the plain-Java and the OSGi client implementations; \
 intentionally free of OSGi runtime dependencies (DS / framework / ConfigAdmin).

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.annotation.versioning,\
	org.osgi.annotation.bundle,\
	org.eclipse.emf.common;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.emf.ecore;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.model.atlas.scope.api;version=snapshot,\
	jakarta.ws.rs-api;version=latest
